SUMMARY:Napa Pride 2026: Rocky Horror Live + Screening with San Francisco's Bawdy Caste
DESCRIPTION:June 18\, 2026\nPURCHASE TICKETS HERE  \nDoors 7pm/ Show 8pm\nAges: 12+ \nStep into a night of cult classic chaos as the The Rocky Horror Picture Show comes alive —on the big screen and right before your eyes all to benefit Napa Pride! \nFor the first time ever in Napa\, the Uptown Theatre is partnering with Napa Pride and San Francisco’s legendary Bawdy Caste to present a one-of-a-kind interactive screening experience. A staple of the Bay Area since 1995\, Bawdy Caste is one of the longest-running Rocky Horror shadow casts\, known for their high-energy\, irreverent\, and wildly entertaining live performances. \nAs the film plays\, the cast performs every scene live in front of the screen—bringing beloved characters\, iconic moments\, and audience-favorite callbacks into a fully immersive celebration of individuality\, camp\, and community. \nWhether you’re a longtime Rocky Horror fan or a first-timer ready to lose your innocence\, this is your invitation to dress up\, shout back\, and be part of the show. \nLet’s do the Time Warp—Napa style.
URL:https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/event/napa-pride-2026-bawdy-caste-present-rocky-horror-live-screening/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/6.18.26-RockyHorror-UTN_1200x800-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
